# scenario: retry-in-finalize
# doc: retry-in-finalize.md
# given: invoked as `claudine compose --claude retry-in-finalize.md` from the directory holding the fixture documents
# given: launch 1 exits 1 with no result; launch 2 exits 0 with a result
# given: finalize returns retry with one extra attempt when err is set
event initialize
event start
work fresh 1
event failure
err provider.exited
event finalize
err provider.exited
event start
work fresh 0
event success
event finalize
err none
exit 0
